# Flutter Admin — Pooja Kit (Product) API Flow

Base URL: `{HOST}/api/v1`  
Auth: `Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>` from `POST /auth/admin-login` (use API JWT, not Firebase ID token on product calls).

**Prerequisite:** Create warehouse rows first — see [Flutter-admin-inventory-flow.plan](Flutter-admin-inventory-flow.plan) for `GET/POST /inventory`, categories, stock fields (`stockQuantity`, `itemQuantity`, `unit`), and inventory unit pricing (`price`, `salePrice`, `currency`). Kit lines reference those inventory ids.

---

## Architecture

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  Inv[InventoryItem stock units]
  Prod[Product pooja kit]
  Order[Order checkout]
  Inv -->|"items[].inventoryItem + quantity"| Prod
  Prod -->|"computed stockQuantity"| Prod
  Order -->|"deducts InventoryItem.stockQuantity"| Inv
```

| Field | Layer | Meaning |
|-------|--------|---------|
| `items[].inventoryItem` | Product | 24-char `InventoryItem` ObjectId |
| `items[].quantity` | Product | **Stock units per kit** (e.g. 2 packs), not grams |
| `price` / `salePrice` / `currency` | Product | **Kit selling price** (customer-facing) |
| `stockQuantity` | Product (API only) | **Computed** max kits buildable from inventory — do not send on create/update |
| `effectivePrice` | Product (virtual) | `salePrice` if set and > 0, else `price` |
| `status` | Product | Review workflow: `DRAFT`, `PENDING`, `APPROVED`, `REJECTED`, `QUEUED` |
| `productStatus` | Product | Publish toggle: `ACTIVE`, `INACTIVE` |

Public catalog only shows `status=APPROVED`, `productStatus=ACTIVE`, and not soft-deleted.

Stock math (read-only on product): for each kit line, `floor(inventory.stockQuantity / line.quantity)`; product `stockQuantity` = minimum across lines. See `inventoryService.computeAvailableKits` in the backend.

---

## Response envelope

Success:

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": { ... },
  "message": "..."
}
```

Error: `{ "success": false, "message": "..." }`

---

## Admin product endpoints

| Method | Path | Auth | Content-Type | Purpose |
|--------|------|------|--------------|---------|
| GET | `/products/my` | admin | — | Products created by logged-in admin |
| GET | `/products/all` | admin | — | Full catalog (any review status) |
| GET | `/products` | optional JWT | — | List/search; admin query flags when JWT present |
| GET | `/products/:id` | optional JWT | — | Detail; admin sees non-public rows |
| POST | `/products/create-product` | admin | `multipart/form-data` | Create kit |
| PATCH | `/products/:id` | admin | `multipart/form-data` | Update kit |
| DELETE | `/products/:id` | admin | — | Soft-delete (`?hard=true` permanent) |
| PATCH | `/products/:id/restore` | admin | — | Undo soft-delete |
| PATCH | `/products/:id/status` | admin | `application/json` | Set `productStatus` ACTIVE/INACTIVE |
| PATCH | `/products/:id/featured` | admin | `application/json` | Set `isFeatured` |
| PUT | `/products/review/:id` | **superadmin** | `application/json` | Approve/reject review |

Public (store app, no admin write): `GET /products/featured`, `GET /products/popular`, `GET /products`, `GET /products/:id`.

---

## Create product

`POST /api/v1/products/create-product`

### Multipart fields

| Field | Required | Notes |
|-------|----------|-------|
| `title` | yes | 2–200 chars |
| `items` | yes | JSON **string** array (see below) |
| `price` | yes | Kit list price, ≥ 0 |
| `currency` | yes | e.g. `ZAR` |
| `salePrice` | no | Must be ≤ `price` |
| `slug` | no | Auto from title if omitted |
| `description` | no | Max 5000 chars |
| `deity` | no | Deity ObjectId (24 hex) |
| `category` | no | Free-text merchandising category |
| `status` | no | `DRAFT` or `PENDING` only (default `PENDING`) |
| `productStatus` | no | `ACTIVE` or `INACTIVE` |
| `isFeatured` | no | `true` / `false` |
| `image` | no | File field name: `image` |

### `items` JSON shape

```json
[
  { "inventoryItem": "674a1b2c3d4e5f6789012345", "quantity": 1 },
  { "inventoryItem": "674a1b2c3d4e5f6789012346", "quantity": 2 }
]
```

- `inventoryItem`: id from `GET /inventory` or inventory create response.
- `quantity`: positive number — stock **units** consumed per kit (not `itemQuantity` grams).
- Each row must exist, `status=ACTIVE`, not deleted.

### curl (bash)

```bash
curl -X POST "${BASE_URL}/api/v1/products/create-product" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer ${ADMIN_JWT}" \
  -F 'title=Ganesh Pooja Kit' \
  -F 'slug=ganesh-pooja-kit' \
  -F 'description=Complete kit for Ganesh Pooja' \
  -F 'items=[{"inventoryItem":"INVENTORY_ID_1","quantity":1},{"inventoryItem":"INVENTORY_ID_2","quantity":2}]' \
  -F 'price=999' \
  -F 'salePrice=799' \
  -F 'currency=ZAR' \
  -F 'category=Ganesh' \
  -F 'status=PENDING' \
  -F 'productStatus=ACTIVE' \
  -F 'isFeatured=false' \
  -F 'image=@/path/to/kit.jpg'
```

### curl (PowerShell)

Escape quotes inside `items`:

```powershell
curl.exe -X POST "$env:BASE_URL/api/v1/products/create-product" `
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $env:ADMIN_JWT" `
  -F "title=Ganesh Pooja Kit" `
  -F "items=[{\`"inventoryItem\`":\`"INVENTORY_ID_1\`",\`"quantity\`":1}]" `
  -F "price=999" `
  -F "currency=ZAR" `
  -F "status=DRAFT"
```

### 201 response (`data.product`)

Includes populated `items.inventoryItem` (full inventory row), computed `stockQuantity`, `effectivePrice`, `status`, `productStatus`, `imageUrl`, timestamps.

---

## Update product

`PATCH /api/v1/products/{id}`

Same multipart fields as create; **at least one** field required. Partial updates supported.

- Admin may set `status` only to `DRAFT` or `PENDING` (not `APPROVED` — use superadmin review).
- Clear `salePrice`: send empty or null on update (Joi allows null).

### curl

```bash
curl -X PATCH "${BASE_URL}/api/v1/products/${PRODUCT_ID}" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer ${ADMIN_JWT}" \
  -F 'title=Ganesh Pooja Kit (Updated)' \
  -F 'price=1099' \
  -F 'salePrice=899' \
  -F 'currency=ZAR' \
  -F 'items=[{"inventoryItem":"INVENTORY_ID_1","quantity":2}]' \
  -F 'productStatus=ACTIVE' \
  -F 'status=DRAFT' \
  -F 'image=@/path/to/new-kit.jpg'
```

---

## List / get (admin)

### My products

```bash
curl -G "${BASE_URL}/api/v1/products/my" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer ${ADMIN_JWT}" \
  --data-urlencode "page=1" \
  --data-urlencode "limit=20" \
  --data-urlencode "status=PENDING" \
  --data-urlencode "productStatus=ACTIVE" \
  --data-urlencode "search=ganesh"
```

Query params: `page`, `limit` (max 100), `status`, `productStatus`, `search`.

### All products (admin catalog)

```bash
curl -G "${BASE_URL}/api/v1/products/all" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer ${ADMIN_JWT}" \
  --data-urlencode "page=1" \
  --data-urlencode "limit=20" \
  --data-urlencode "status=APPROVED" \
  --data-urlencode "includeDeleted=false"
```

### List with admin filters (optional JWT on public URL)

`GET /api/v1/products` with same admin query params when Bearer token is sent: `status`, `productStatus`, `isFeatured`, `inStock`, `minPrice`, `maxPrice`, `sortBy` (`createdAt`|`price`|`title`|`purchaseCount`), `sortOrder` (`asc`|`desc`), `includeDeleted`, `deity`, `category`, `search`.

### Get by id

```bash
curl "${BASE_URL}/api/v1/products/${PRODUCT_ID}" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer ${ADMIN_JWT}"
```

Response: `items[].inventoryItem` populated; top-level `stockQuantity` = kits buildable.

---

## Delete / restore

**Soft delete** (sets inactive, keeps review status):

```bash
curl -X DELETE "${BASE_URL}/api/v1/products/${PRODUCT_ID}" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer ${ADMIN_JWT}"
```

**Hard delete** (removes document and S3 image):

```bash
curl -X DELETE "${BASE_URL}/api/v1/products/${PRODUCT_ID}?hard=true" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer ${ADMIN_JWT}"
```

**Restore**

```bash
curl -X PATCH "${BASE_URL}/api/v1/products/${PRODUCT_ID}/restore" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer ${ADMIN_JWT}"
```

---

## Publish and featured (JSON)

**Publish toggle** (`productStatus` only; does not change review `status`):

```bash
curl -X PATCH "${BASE_URL}/api/v1/products/${PRODUCT_ID}/status" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer ${ADMIN_JWT}" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"productStatus":"INACTIVE"}'
```

**Featured flag**

```bash
curl -X PATCH "${BASE_URL}/api/v1/products/${PRODUCT_ID}/featured" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer ${ADMIN_JWT}" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"isFeatured":true}'
```

---

## Superadmin review

`PUT /api/v1/products/review/{id}`

```bash
curl -X PUT "${BASE_URL}/api/v1/products/review/${PRODUCT_ID}" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer ${SUPERADMIN_JWT}" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"status":"APPROVED"}'
```

Allowed values: `APPROVED`, `REJECTED`, `QUEUED`, `DRAFT`.

---

## Review workflow

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> DRAFT: create status=DRAFT
  [*] --> PENDING: create default
  DRAFT --> PENDING: admin patch
  PENDING --> APPROVED: superadmin review
  PENDING --> REJECTED: superadmin review
  PENDING --> QUEUED: superadmin review
  APPROVED --> ACTIVE: productStatus ACTIVE
```

| `status` | Who sets | Meaning |
|----------|----------|---------|
| `DRAFT` | Admin | Work in progress |
| `PENDING` | Admin (default on create) | Submitted for review |
| `APPROVED` | Superadmin | Visible to public if `productStatus=ACTIVE` |
| `REJECTED` | Superadmin | Needs revision |
| `QUEUED` | Superadmin | Held for later |

---

## Product vs inventory pricing

| | Inventory item | Product (kit) |
|--|----------------|---------------|
| Purpose | List price per **stock unit** (pack) | Customer **kit** price |
| Fields | `price`, `salePrice`, `currency` on `InventoryItem` | Same names on `Product` |
| Stock field | `stockQuantity` = pack count in warehouse | `stockQuantity` = max kits (derived) |

Kit BOM does **not** auto-sum inventory prices; set kit `price` explicitly (optional client-side helper only).

---

## Flutter implementation

### Recommended flow

1. Admin login → store `accessToken`.
2. Load categories/inventory: `GET /inventory/categories`, `GET /inventory?status=ACTIVE` (see inventory plan).
3. **Kit list screen** → `GET /products/my`.
4. **Kit editor** → multipart `POST /create-product` or `PATCH /:id`.
5. **Inventory picker** → multi-select rows; per line enter “units per kit”; build `items` and `jsonEncode` into form field `items`.
6. Show read-only `stockQuantity` from save/get response; block publish if 0 when business rules require stock.

### Screens

| Screen | API | Notes |
|--------|-----|-------|
| Kit list | `GET /products/my` | Filter chips: `status`, `productStatus` |
| Kit detail | `GET /products/:id` | Show BOM with populated inventory |
| Kit editor | POST/PATCH multipart | Price row + image + inventory lines |
| Publish toggle | `PATCH .../status` | JSON body |
| Featured toggle | `PATCH .../featured` | JSON body |
| Superadmin queue | `GET /products/all?status=PENDING` | + `PUT .../review/:id` |

### Dart models (sketch)

```dart
class PoojaKitLine {
  final String inventoryItem;
  final double quantity; // stock units per kit
}

class Product {
  final String id;
  final String title;
  final String slug;
  final String? imageUrl;
  final List<PoojaKitLine> items;
  final double price;
  final double? salePrice;
  final String currency;
  final double effectivePrice;
  final int stockQuantity; // computed, read-only
  final String status;
  final String productStatus;
  final bool isFeatured;
}
```

Use `http.MultipartRequest` or `dio` `FormData`; file field name **`image`**.

### Client validation (mirror backend)

- `items` non-empty; each `quantity` > 0.
- `salePrice` ≤ `price` when set.
- All inventory ids active before submit (handle 400: missing/inactive inventory).

---

## Errors

| HTTP | Typical cause |
|------|----------------|
| 400 | Invalid `items` JSON, empty items, bad inventory id, `salePrice > price` |
| 401 | Missing or expired JWT |
| 403 | Non-admin on write; non-superadmin on review |
| 404 | Product or inventory not found |
| 409 | Duplicate `slug` |

---

## Auth quick reference

```bash
# 1) Firebase password sign-in on device → ID token
# 2) Exchange for API tokens
curl -X POST "${BASE_URL}/api/v1/auth/admin-login" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer ${FIREBASE_ID_TOKEN}"

# 3) Use data.accessToken on all /products admin calls
```

